', 3399.0, 2289.0, NULL, 'Audio > Home Audio & Speakers > Speakers', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7reo6-m8p649l0xr2x85', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1101261117%2F23598403553', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
