mente No Chat Antes De Dar a Sua Estrelinha :)🔥🔥🔥', 78.0, 38.07, NULL, 'Home & Living > Dinnerware > Cutleries', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/br-11134207-7r98o-m290k39uqz4622', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1224363395%2F20497972703', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
