 e carregadores compatíveis com notebooks Dell, Lenovo, Acer, HP, Asus e muito mais!', 121.04, 121.04, NULL, 'Computers & Accessories > Desktop & Laptop Components > Power Supply Units', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-825ao-mr15howy0ikl7a', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F392651618%2F44375370973', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
